        "content": {"kind": "docx", "paragraphs": ["Failure analysis procedure for ApexDrive X500. Step 1: isolate the unit within 45 minutes of the alarm. Step 2: capture the thermal log for at least 1200 seconds before power down. Step 3: record the serial number, firmware revision and operator initials on form QA-7. Step 4: escalate any repeat failure above 3 units per shift to the quality lead. The current review interval for this procedure is twelve months and all deviations must be logged against the controlling record."]},
