      {
        "key": "fal-2026",
        "kind": "file",
        "path": "Failure Analysis Limits (2026).docx",
        "unique": false,
        "modified": "2026-01-11T09:00:00Z",
        "size": 5160,
        "content": {"kind": "docx", "paragraphs": ["Failure analysis procedure for ApexDrive X500. Step 1: isolate the unit within 60 minutes of the alarm. Step 2: capture the thermal log for at least 1500 seconds before power down. Step 3: record the serial number, firmware revision and operator initials on form QA-7. Step 4: escalate any repeat failure above 2 units per shift to the quality lead. The approved review interval for this procedure is twelve months and all deviations must be logged against the controlling record."]},
